      "order": 2,
      "text": "For regulation 3.12, the following shall be substituted: '3.12 Building Height and Stilt Floor Exemption: Building height shall be measured from the average level of the abutting street to the terrace slab. One or two stilt floors used exclusively for vehicle parking up to a cumulative height of 4.5 metres shall be exempt from FAR computation and included in total building height for setback and fire safety classification.'",
